WEBVTT

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:31.336
So, pilot, some mini me,

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:35.536
has to get in there and dig a little,

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.056
see what's going on,

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.976
try to find out where my fears come from,

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.640
where my anger comes from,

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:47.240
and then try to repair them
by understanding them.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.616
(Applause)

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.896
So, thank you, little pilot.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.176
(Applause)

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.696
I bet some of you guys

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:03.120
have little pilots working inside, too.